{"availability":"available","full":"0x00C0DE/0x00C0DE.github.io","name":"0x00C0DE.github.io","description":"Browser-native Unix-like terminal portfolio built with HTML, JavaScript, and Canvas, featuring file-backed content, Bitcoin analytics and forecasting dashboards, Cloudflare Worker publishing, and password-plus-TOTP privileged sessions.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2023-02-21T19:35:30Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:05:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://0x00c0de.github.io/","topics":["bitcoin","canvas","cloudflare-workers","data-visualization","developer-portfolio","github-pages","html5","javascript","responsive-design","technical-analysis","time-series-forecasting","totp","two-factor-authentication","unix","web-terminal"],"demo":"https://0x00c0de.github.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.308Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.308Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.308Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:26.206Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:22:53.864Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T09:24:30.170Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:01.144Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.308Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static, browser-native terminal portfolio built around a canvas-first Pretext renderer. No frameworks. No frontend build step. No DOM reflow-driven text layout in the live terminal path.","0x00C0DE.github.io is a browser-based Unix-like terminal that serves as a developer portfolio. The live UI is now rendered directly into a visible instead of being composed out of styled DOM rows, and multiline text layout is delegated to Cheng Lou's Pretext so the terminal can wrap, relayout, and route text without relying on getBoundingClientRect, offsetHeight, or browser reflow as part of the main rendering path.","The design philosophy is still file-system-first: documentation lives as real .txt files fetched over HTTP at runtime, mirroring how a real terminal would cat files off disk. This keeps content versionable, diffable, and human-readable without introducing a database or a frontend toolchain."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0x00C0DE/0x00C0DE.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"62a14a231f3b07ed5e308c2ad62703e0c71d7cb88850469299217f48ebee64b2","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:41.294Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.459Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A static, browser-native terminal portfolio built around a canvas-first Pretext renderer. No frameworks. No frontend build step. No DOM reflow-driven text layout in the live terminal path.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0x00C0DE/0x00C0DE.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"62a14a231f3b07ed5e308c2ad62703e0c71d7cb88850469299217f48ebee64b2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0x00C0DE/0x00C0DE.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.460Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T19:05:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0x00C0DE/0x00C0DE.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.461Z","hash":"62a14a231f3b07ed5e308c2ad62703e0c71d7cb88850469299217f48ebee64b2","originalBytes":54721,"storedBytes":54721,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:25.308Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T07:32:26.867Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T07:32:26.867Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/4d5d2c24f042d3899edc71cb.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-12T19:28:21.101Z","url":"https://0x00c0de.github.io/"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:28:21.101Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://0x00c0de.github.io/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T19:28:21.100Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:28:21.100Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-12